# braces CVE-2026-93687 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm) — stack-exhaustion DoS from deeply
# nested brace patterns. No patched release exists (all versions <= 3.0.3 affected;
# 3.0.3 is latest). braces only expands glob patterns written by developers, via
# @next/eslint-plugin-next -> fast-glob -> micromatch (lint) and
# @payloadcms/next -> sass@1.77.4 -> chokidar@3 (sass CLI watch mode). No request
# input reaches it. Expires so the entry is revisited; drop it once braces ships a fix.
CVE-2026-93687 exp:2027-01-04
